id: SCA-048
title: Cargo.toml proc-macro from git source
category: supply-chain
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Cargo.toml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
  content_contains: proc-macro
patterns:
  - regex: proc-macro.*git\s*=
    message: Procedural macros execute at compile time with full build machine access. A git-sourced proc-macro bypasses crates.io review.
fix: Only use proc-macros from crates.io. If a git source is necessary, pin to a specific rev and audit the macro code thoroughly.
